{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7thシングル、最後の握手会ありがとうございました(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が来て下さってハッピーでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村Pのコスプレはいかがでしたでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/03/06/1698344/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「姫様、スカートが曲がっておりますわよ」の図。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんの手により、お姫様にさせられましたヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなの初めてなんよーヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ\nウキウキやでヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ\n松村Pにいっぱい写真撮られたんよーヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこれは白石のブログです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにも褒めて頂き、松村P大喜びでしたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、メイドさんにもなりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/03/06/1698344/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/03/06/1698344/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏も誘って三人で♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構好評だったので、また8枚目とかで松村様にプロデュースしてもらおうかと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7th、皆さんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、お隣にNMBさんもいらしてたので、ご挨拶に行きました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/03/06/1698344/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん半端なく可愛かった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、菜々ちゃんがぐぐたすに書いて下さってて嬉しかったです(>_<)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会えなくて残念(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃんが生誕祭で貰った手紙を見せてくれたんだけど、ユカフィンさんが私のことを書いて下さっていました♡...>_<..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます、私も大好きです♡\nまたお仕事でお会いできるといいなぁ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、可愛い子に目がありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌とか見てて好き！って思ったモデルさんとかがたくさん>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはまた次の更新でお話しますね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、明日も一日お仕事なのでこの辺で..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お休みなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}